The relational schema for Dove Bank Ltd consists of three tables:

CUSTOMERS
(customer_id PK, first_name, last_name, email, phone)

ACCOUNTS
(account_id PK, customer_id FK, account_number, account_type, balance)

TRANSACTIONS
(transaction_id PK, account_id FK, transaction_type, amount, transaction_date)

Relationships
ACCOUNTS.customer_id references CUSTOMERS.customer_id.
TRANSACTIONS.account_id references ACCOUNTS.account_id.
